          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.delete.body" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete any record in the app at any time. Deleting the app removes all of its data from your device. Backup files you exported are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以随时在 App 内删除任何记录。删除 App 会移除它在设备上的所有数据，但不会影响你已导出的备份文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以隨時在 App 內刪除任何紀錄。刪除 App 會移除它在裝置上的所有資料，但不會影響你已匯出的備份檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.delete.title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deleting your data"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除你的数据"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刪除你的資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.device.body" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your passport, trips, wishlist, visas and attachments, profile, friends' travel cards and settings are stored only in the app's own folder on your iPhone. They may be included in your iCloud or computer backups, depending on your device settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的护照、旅程、心愿清单、签证及附件、个人资料、朋友的旅行卡和设置，只会存储在 iPhone 上这个 App 的专属文件夹内。根据你的设备设置，它们可能会包含在 iCloud 或电脑备份中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的護照、旅程、願望清單、簽證及附件、個人資料、朋友的旅行卡和設定，只會儲存在 iPhone 上這個 App 的專屬資料夾內。視乎你的裝置設定，它們可能會包含在 iCloud 或電腦備份中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.device.title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What stays on your device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哪些数据保留在你的设备上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哪些資料留在你的裝置上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.intro" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where Can I Go is built so that your travel records stay yours. This policy explains what that means."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「跟住去边度」的设计原则是：你的旅行记录只属于你。以下说明这意味着什么。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「跟住去邊度」的設計原則是：你的旅行紀錄只屬於你。以下說明這代表甚麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.leave.body" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only when you choose to:\n• **Export a backup.** The file goes wherever you save or send it.\n• **Share a travel card or image.** It contains only what you chose in Settings → Sharing. Notes, passport, My Visas and visa attachments are never included.\n• **Search the web for a country.** Your chosen search engine receives the search.\n• **Open a link or send feedback.** The website or your mail app handles it under its own policy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在你主动选择时：\n• **导出备份**。文件会去到你保存或发送的地方。\n• **分享旅行卡或图片**。只包含你在「设置 → 分享设置」中选择的内容，绝不包含备注、护照、我的签证及签证附件。\n• **在网上搜索国家**。你选择的搜索引擎会收到搜索内容。\n• **打开链接或发送反馈**。由相关网站或你的邮件 App 按其自身政策处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在你主動選擇時：\n• **匯出備份**。檔案會去到你儲存或傳送的地方。\n• **分享旅行卡或圖片**。只包含你在「設定 → 分享設定」中選擇的內容，絕不包含備註、護照、我的簽證及簽證附件。\n• **在網上搜尋國家**。你選擇的搜尋引擎會收到搜尋內容。\n• **開啟連結或傳送意見**。由相關網站或你的郵件 App 按其自身政策處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.leave.title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When data leaves your device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据何时会离开你的设备"
          }
        },
