    },
    "You already have a friend with this name. This card comes from a different sharing identity, such as a new phone or a different person. Replace the existing friend only after comparing safety codes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已有同名的朋友。这张名片来自另一个分享身份，可能是对方换了手机，也可能是另一个人。请先核对安全码，再决定是否替换现有朋友。"
